    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Duffy Property are delighted to present this beautiful three-bedroom, first floor duplex apartment for sale in the much sought-after development of Ruanbeg Manor in Kildare Town.\r\n\r\nThis stunning property offers potential buyers a fantastic opportunity to acquire a B BER rated modern apartment that is in pristine condition and is ready to move into.  A brand new Bosch gas boiler has just been installed and new carpets have been fitted to the hallway, stairs, landing and all three bedrooms. \r\n\r\nThe property is nestled away in a small block of apartments in a quiet part of this popular development with one allocated parking space. \r\n\r\nThe apartment benefits from a number of impressive features including: BER: B, gas central heating with brand new Bosch gas boiler, freshly painted throughout, new carpets fitted in hallway, stairs, landing & all 3 bedrooms, generous living space extending to 133 Sq. M., PVC double glazed windows & doors, spacious balcony, own-door first-floor apartment, fitted blinds, allocated parking space, large storage shed, quiet location, large sunny communal garden area, large separate kitchen & sitting room, three large double bedrooms with built in wardrobes and two bathrooms. \r\n\r\nExcellent location in a quiet part of a popular, family friendly estate only minutes from all local services including: primary & secondary schools, playground, petrol stations, bank, restaurants, cafes & shops.\r\n\r\nLidl, Aldi, Tesco, Centra etc. and Kildare Village Shopping Outlet are all close by. \r\n\r\nThe property is located just a few minutes from the M7 Motorway (Choice of Exit 12 or 13) and is within easy commuting distance to Dublin City Centre. \r\n\r\nKildare Train Station is within easy access and Kildare Town is also served by excellent bus routes making commuting to Dublin extremely convenient.\r\n\r\nThe beautiful Curragh Plains is located just a few minutes walk from the property, with approximately 5,000 acres of natural grassland, it is a fantastic amenity on your doorstep, perfect for outdoor activities or peaceful walks.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate its high quality."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway (1.19m x 1.05m, 1.04m x 2.71m, 3.32m x 1.91m) \r\nEntrance Hall: Tiled floor. \r\nHallway: New carpet floor, radiator cover, three light fittings, spacious hallway.  \r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room (4.16m x 3.88m)\r\nTiled floor & tiled splash back, fully fitted modern kitchen with floor & eye level units, newly fitted Bosch gas boiler, built in stainless steel electric oven, Hotpoint four ring ceramic hob, extractor fan, two windows allowing extensive natural light, double doors leading to sitting room, bright spacious kitchen.\r\n\r\nSitting Room (4.91m x 4.66m)\r\nWood floor, feature light fitting, two windows allowing extensive natural light, double doors leading to kitchen / dining room.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (3.74m x 3.23m)\r\nNew carpet floor, large built-in wardrobes, large PVC double doors leading to spacious balcony, ample space for furniture & storage.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (3.58m x 2.97m)\r\nNew carpet wood floor, large built-in wardrobes (two double), large window, ample space for furniture & storage.\r\n\r\nDownstairs Bathroom (2.95m x 1.67m)\r\nTiled floor, large corner shower tiled floor to ceiling, double radiator, W/C, wash hand basin with vanity light.\r\n\r\nLanding (5.28m x 3.16m)\r\nNew carpet floor, large window, bright spacious landing. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (6.00m x 5.00m) \r\nNew carpet floor, two windows allowing extensive natural light, built in wardrobes, large bedroom with ample space for furniture & storage, \r\n\r\nUpstairs Bathroom (3.97m x 2.12m)\r\nTiled floor, large bath with Triton T90 electric shower & glass shower, large window, wash hand basin with vanity light, W/C, door to hot press with ample shelved storage."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
